    "body": "Duplicate of #600, already fixed on main by 896fa495 (`fix(ui): orthographic depth maps into WebGPU's clip volume, not OpenGL's`, merged 2026-11-10). The ortho projection's depth row used OpenGL's [-1, +1] span, so WebGPU clipped everything in view and the part vanished. It ships in the next minor release (it isn't in any tag yet, so 0.16.0 and earlier still show it). If you still see it in a build that carries 896fa495, reopen this issue with what you saw. Releasing my claim.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
